    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 216</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_216/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 00:31:44 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_216/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#xA;&#xA;func main() {&#xA;&#x9;i := 65&#xA;&#x9;fmt.Println(string(i))&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A. A&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;B. 65&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;C. compilation error&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Reference Answer and Analysis: A.&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://go.dev/play/p/h8IE-NTMImR&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Run online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In UTF-8 encoding, the decimal number 65 corresponds to the symbol &amp;lsquo;A&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
    </item>
